Modifications in this distribution, relative to upstream Strix:

  1. Added read-only SIEM detection attribution (`strix siem`):
     strix/report/siem.py, strix/interface/siem_cli.py, and the `siem`
     subcommand dispatch in strix/interface/main.py.
  2. Added tests for the above (tests/test_siem_attribution.py).
  3. Added documentation (docs/integrations/siem-attribution.mdx,
     docs/PORTED_FROM_PENTESTINGTOOL.md) and a README section.

The SIEM attribution design was informed by reading mahi80/pentestingtool,
which carries no license; no source code from that project was copied. The
implementation here is original and written against Strix's own data model.

